# Live instance data. docker-compose mounts ./data and ./backups from inside
# this checkout, so a local `docker compose build` would otherwise copy the
# family photo library and gzipped database dumps into a builder layer. CI
# builds from a clean checkout and never sees these, which is precisely why
# the gap went unnoticed locally.
data/
backups/
*.sql
*.sql.gz
